+          "A torn laboratory patch lies half-buried beside the route. Its logo resembles the one on a Department Store advertisement. Under the dirt, the stitching reads PROJECT — 0001."
+        ],
+        "outro": [
+          "You memorize the number before putting the patch away. A project has a purpose, a maker, and someone who decided it could begin. You intend to learn which of those the number is hiding."
+        ]
+      }
+    },
+    "extra.mewtwo.ending": {
+      "title": "More Than a Number",
+      "body": "The laboratory seal is dated this morning. Through the glass, the clipboard reads 0001, 0002, 0003. Beside the third number is your name, spelled correctly.",
+      "phases": {
+        "climax": [
+          "The laboratory seal is dated this morning. Through the glass, the clipboard reads 0001, 0002, 0003. Beside the third number is your name, spelled correctly."
+        ],
+        "outro": [
+          "You copy the date and the name instead of accepting the label. Your partner waits at your side while you finish. Whatever the laboratory expected you to become, it will have to account for the choices you have already made."
+        ]
+      }
+    }
+  }
+}
diff --git a/game-upgrades.css b/game-upgrades.css
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..c151c1a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/game-upgrades.css
@@ -0,0 +1,53 @@
+/* Shared product surfaces: Notebook, preparation, practice, recovery and support. */
+:root { --upgrade-space: 1rem; --upgrade-body: 0.875rem; }
+.upgrade-overlay { position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:16000; display:grid; place-items:center; padding:max(12px,env(safe-area-inset-top)) max(12px,env(safe-area-inset-right)) max(12px,env(safe-area-inset-bottom)) max(12px,env(safe-area-inset-left)); background:rgb(3 7 14 / 90%); box-sizing:border-box; }
+.upgrade-dialog { width:min(960px,100%); max-height:100%; overflow:auto; overscroll-behavior:contain; border:1px solid var(--border-color,#506078); border-radius:var(--radius-lg,12px); background:var(--surface,#101a29); color:var(--text-color,#eef3fc); padding:clamp(12px,3vw,28px); box-sizing:border-box; font-size:var(--upgrade-body); line-height:1.7; }
+.upgrade-dialog * { box-sizing:border-box; }
+.upgrade-header { display:flex; align-items:flex-start; justify-content:space-between; gap:16px; position:sticky; top:-1px; background:var(--surface,#101a29); z-index:1; padding-bottom:12px; }
+.upgrade-header h2 { margin:0; color:var(--accent,#8ee7d2); font-size:clamp(16px,2.8vw,24px); line-height:1.5; }
+.upgrade-dialog h3 { margin:0 0 8px; font-size:1rem; line-height:1.6; }
+.upgrade-dialog p { margin:0 0 12px; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
+.upgrade-actions,.upgrade-tabs,.upgrade-settings-actions { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; margin:12px 0; }
+.upgrade-dialog button,.upgrade-settings-actions button,.upgrade-save-alert button { min-height:44px; min-width:44px; padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #668096; border-radius:var(--radius-md,8px); background:#1b3043; color:#f2f7ff; font:inherit; line-height:1.5; cursor:pointer; white-space:normal; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
+.upgrade-dialog button:hover,.upgrade-dialog button:focus-visible { background:#294b60; }
+.upgrade-dialog button:focus-visible,.upgrade-dialog input:focus-visible,.upgrade-dialog textarea:focus-visible { outline:3px solid #a9efbc; outline-offset:3px; }
+.upgrade-dialog button:disabled { opacity:0.6; cursor:default; }
+.upgrade-dialog .upgrade-primary,.upgrade-tabs button[aria-current="page"] { background:#a9efbc; border-color:#a9efbc; color:#092217; }
+.upgrade-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(260px,100%),1fr)); gap:12px; margin:12px 0; }
+.upgrade-card { min-width:0; border:1px solid #40556c; border-radius:var(--radius-md,8px); padding:16px; background:#142233; }
+.upgrade-card small,.upgrade-muted { color:#bdcbdc; }
+.upgrade-card dl { display:grid; grid-template-columns:auto 1fr; gap:4px 12px; margin:8px 0; }
+.upgrade-card dd { margin:0; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
+.upgrade-dialog input:not([type="checkbox"]),.upgrade-dialog textarea,.upgrade-dialog select { width:100%; min-width:0; min-height:44px; padding:10px; background:#091421; border:1px solid #73889e; border-radius:6px; color:#f2f7ff; font:inherit; }
+.upgrade-dialog textarea { min-height:160px; resize:vertical; }
+.upgrade-dialog label { display:block; margin:12px 0; }
+.upgrade-dialog input[type="checkbox"] { width:22px; height:22px; margin:0 10px 0 0; vertical-align:middle; }
+.upgrade-feedback { padding:12px; border-left:4px solid #a9efbc; background:#172e28; margin:12px 0; }
+.upgrade-save-alert { position:fixed; inset:auto 12px max(12px,env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); z-index:17000; display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:12px; padding:12px; border:2px solid #ffc277; border-radius:10px; background:#332012; color:#fff4e8; font-size:14px; }
+.upgrade-save-alert p { margin:0; max-width:620px; }
+.upgrade-service-notice { max-width:440px; padding:16px; color:var(--text-color); line-height:1.7; }
+.upgrade-readable,.upgrade-readable button,.upgrade-readable input,.upgrade-readable select { font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif; }
+.upgrade-large-text { --upgrade-body:1.05rem; }
+.upgrade-large-text .story-dialogue-text,.upgrade-large-text .story-journal-body { font-size:1rem; line-height:1.8; }
+.upgrade-reduced-motion * { scroll-behavior:auto !important; animation-duration:0.001ms !important; animation-iteration-count:1 !important; transition-duration:0.001ms !important; }
+.upgrade-inline-help { display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin:8px 0; }
+@media (max-width:600px) {
+  .upgrade-overlay { align-items:stretch; }
+  .upgrade-dialog { border-radius:8px; }
+  .upgrade-actions > button { flex:1 1 140px; }
+  .upgrade-tabs > button { flex:1 1 100px; }
+}
+@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { .upgrade-dialog * { scroll-behavior:auto; transition:none; animation:none; } }
+
+/* Shared navigation and input affordances across existing campaign screens. */
+.upgrade-action-purpose { display:block; margin-top:6px; font-size:0.72rem; font-weight:normal; line-height:1.6; color:var(--text-muted,#c0cede); letter-spacing:normal; white-space:normal; }
+.upgrade-inline-help button { min-height:44px; padding:10px 14px; line-height:1.6; white-space:normal; }
+.screen button:focus-visible,.modal button:focus-visible,.story-action-btn:focus-visible { outline:3px solid var(--hp-green,#a9efbc); outline-offset:3px; }
+@media (pointer:coarse) {
+  .screen button,.modal button,.story-action-btn { min-height:44px; touch-action:manipulation; }
+  .screen input,.screen select,.modal input,.modal select { min-height:44px; font-size:max(16px,1em); }
+}
+@media (max-width:600px) {
+  .upgrade-inline-help button { flex:1 1 150px; }
+  .story-action-btn-text { min-width:0; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
+}
